{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790259742400,"sessionID":"ses_f2c384d73ffel5mIo78mZwosTI","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"sg_call_45b6873990a49_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd\n@@\n extends Node3D\n \n+const WEAPON_CLIP_SHADER: Shader = preload(\"res://shaders/weapon_clip_and_fov_shader.gdshader\")\n+\n @onready var view_model_container: Node3D = $ViewModel\n \n func _ready() -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tapply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(view_model_container, 54.0)\n \n func apply_clip_and_fov_shader_to_view_model(node3d: Node3D, fov_or_negative_for_unchanged := -1.0) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tfor child in node3d.find_children(\"*\", \"MeshInstance3D\", true, false):\n+\t\tvar mesh_instance := child as MeshInstance3D\n+\t\tif mesh_instance.mesh == null:\n+\t\t\tcontinue\n+\n+\t\tfor surface_index in mesh_instance.mesh.get_surface_count():\n+\t\t\tvar base_material := mesh_instance.get_active_material(surface_index)\n+\t\t\tvar shader_material := ShaderMaterial.new()\n+\t\t\tshader_material.shader = WEAPON_CLIP_SHADER\n+\n+\t\t\tif base_material is StandardMaterial3D:\n+\t\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"albedo\", base_material.albedo_color)\n+\t\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"metallic\", base_material.metallic)\n+\t\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"roughness\", base_material.roughness)\n+\n+\t\t\tif fov_or_negative_for_unchanged >= 0.0:\n+\t\t\t\tshader_material.set_shader_parameter(\"viewmodel_fov\", fov_or_negative_for_unchanged)\n+\n+\t\t\tmesh_instance.set_surface_override_material(surface_index, shader_material)\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/weapon_manager.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/weapon_